\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Before-and-after headline results, one panel per dataset, each on its native metric. Left: MMFakeBench test macro-F1, baseline 0.2037 to winner 0.6020. Centre: NewsCLIPpings validation accuracy, baseline 0.5141 to trained 0.5104, a null result. Right: VERITE accuracy under transfer only, baseline 0.3467 to 0.3506, near-flat. The three metrics are never averaged across datasets.}}{4}{}\protected@file@percent }
